WEBVTT

00:05:59.988 --> 00:06:01.511
Being a surrogate donor

00:06:01.511 --> 00:06:04.299
only requires you to say a few hundred

00:06:04.299 --> 00:06:06.541
to a few thousand utterances.

00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:08.544
The process goes something like this.

00:06:08.544 --> 00:06:10.734
(Video) Voice: Things happen in pairs.

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:12.659
I love to sleep.

00:06:12.659 --> 00:06:16.541
The sky is blue without clouds.

00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:18.543
RP: Now she's going to go on like this

00:06:18.543 --> 00:06:20.462
for about three to four hours,

00:06:20.462 --> 00:06:23.467
and the idea is not for her to say everything

00:06:23.467 --> 00:06:25.512
that the target is going to want to say,

00:06:25.512 --> 00:06:28.907
but the idea is to cover all the different combinations

00:06:28.907 --> 00:06:32.178
of the sounds that occur in the language.